DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31185::$$$message_0234_0000_0000$$$::The mountain gate is silent.[lr]::
31186::$$$message_0234_0000_0001$$$::The stone steps stretch into the night sky.[lr]::
31187::$$$message_0234_0000_0002$$$::...For some reason, the long stairway appears as if it extends into the sky itself.[lr]::
31188::$$$message_0234_0000_0003$$$::Fortunately, the moon isn't directly above Ryudou Temple, so the stairs end at the temple, rather than literally leading to some otherworldly lunar realm.::
31189::$$$message_0234_0001_0000$$$::I peer into the temple from the gate.[lr]::
31190::$$$message_0234_0001_0001$$$::Nothing seems amiss in the temple grounds.[lr]::
31191::$$$message_0234_0001_0002$$$::If I want to investigate further, I'll have to go inside...[lr]::
31192::$$$message_0234_0001_0003$$$::"...You there. Take another step and you'll lose your head."[lr]::
31193::$$$message_0234_0001_0004$$$::...but as you can see, a Servant still guards the mountain gate.::
31194::$$$message_0234_0002_0000$$$::"You must have a lot of free time, if you're still upholding your role when you don't need to protect this place anymore.[lr]::
31195::$$$message_0234_0002_0001$$$::...Wait. Are there a lot of burglars trying to steal the Buddha statues lately?"::
31196::$$$message_0234_0003_0000$$$::"Haha. I haven't seen any thieves, but others have passed through these gates. See? One just went right by you."[lr]::
31197::$$$message_0234_0003_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
31198::$$$message_0234_0003_0002$$$::Of course, there's no one there.[lr]::
31199::$$$message_0234_0003_0003$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=小次郎01b(遠)]All I feel is a lukewarm breeze against my cheek.::
31200::$$$message_0234_0004_0000$$$::"Cut that out. It's forbidden to tell ghost stories at a temple.[lr]::
31201::$$$message_0234_0004_0001$$$::I'm freaked out enough already being here on my own, so you don't need to intimidate..."[lr]::
31202::$$$message_0234_0004_0002$$$::Oh, I see.[lr]::
31203::$$$message_0234_0004_0003$$$::Servants are spirits too, so he might actually mean it.::
31204::$$$message_0234_0005_0000$$$::"...Hey, are there really ghosts around here?"[lr]::
31205::$$$message_0234_0005_0001$$$::"Indeed. You've just failed to notice them.[lr]::
31206::$$$message_0234_0005_0002$$$::In life, I was a humble peasant. I never had any sense for the spiritual, and I only became aware of others like me once I was summoned here."::
31207::$$$message_0234_0006_0000$$$::That makes sense.[lr]::
31208::$$$message_0234_0006_0001$$$::...Well, if I can't see them, then no harm done.[lr]::
31209::$$$message_0234_0006_0002$$$::The only ghosts that can hurt humans are the ones that we can see.[lr]::
31210::$$$message_0234_0006_0003$$$::If they're invisible, then they won't pose a threat to my life, no matter what they are.::
31211::$$$message_0234_0007_0000$$$::"Try dying once, if you'd like to know more.[lr]::
31212::$$$message_0234_0007_0001$$$::I'm sure the vixen would readily give you a quick death, if you ask."[lr]::
31213::$$$message_0234_0007_0002$$$::"No thanks. I don't trust Caster as far as I can throw her.[lr]::
31214::$$$message_0234_0007_0003$$$::She might say yes at first out of goodwill, but I have a feeling she'd get a flash of evil inspiration midway and betray me on the altar."::
31215::$$$message_0234_0008_0000$$$::"I can't argue with that. You should be careful whenever she's dressed as a Servant."::
31216::$$$message_0234_0009_0000$$$::Caster's probably a good woman at heart.[lr]::
31217::$$$message_0234_0009_0001$$$::She's reformed now, but after living a life stained with treachery and dirty dealings, she still has moments when she smirks and slips back into witch mode.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0][lr]::
31218::$$$message_0234_0009_0002$$$::Among the Servants I shouldn't let my guard down around, [chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=キャスターローブ無し02b(近)]she's got to be one of the riskiest.::
31219::$$$message_0234_0010_0000$$$::"But what business have you here tonight?[lr]::
31220::$$$message_0234_0010_0001$$$::I suggest you come back during daytime if it's something mundane. I may no longer be obligated to guard this gate, but her Command Spells still bind me. I can't stay my blade against any who would come at this hour."::
31221::$$$message_0234_0011_0000$$$::"Oh, I see. She used a Command Spell to make you stand guard here."[lr]::
31222::$$$message_0234_0011_0001$$$::This Servant was unrelated to the Holy Grail War, to begin with. Assassin's only role was to intercept enemies who attempted to breach the gate with his sword.[lr]::
31223::$$$message_0234_0011_0002$$$::He wouldn't have anything to do with disturbances in town, nor would he care.::
31224::$$$message_0234_0012_0000$$$::"...I'm leaving. Sorry for the intrusion."[lr]::
31225::$$$message_0234_0012_0001$$$::"Oh, did you just come here to chat?"::
31226::$$$message_0234_0013_0000$$$::"If you're just standing guard, then we're good.[lr]::
31227::$$$message_0234_0013_0001$$$::I'll bring you a gift the next time I visit."[lr]::
31228::$$$message_0234_0013_0002$$$::I leave the mountain gate.::
31229::$$$message_0234_0014_0000$$$::"Well, well. Then do come back with a pretty flower in hand[line len=2]no, make that two.[lr]::
31230::$$$message_0234_0014_0001$$$::Not that I'm complaining, but it's rather disgraceful for a man to be alone on such a moonlit night."::
31231::$$$message_0234_0015_0000$$$::I think he's asking me to bring Saber and Rider.[lr]::
31232::$$$message_0234_0015_0001$$$::I'm not sure whether to call him bold or bizarre.[lr]::
31233::$$$message_0234_0015_0002$$$::He might be the only guy who'd make a pass at two Servants who used to be his mortal enemies.::
31234::$$$message_0234_0016_0000$$$::Though... I can relate.[lr]::
31235::$$$message_0234_0016_0001$$$::A beautiful springtime night like this might be a nice occasion for an evening party.::
931196::$$$message_9234_0003_0000$$$::"Haha. I haven't seen any thieves, but others have passed through these gates. See? One just went right by you."[r]::
�